    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Welcome to\nAIR\nCALIFORNIA\nand this Boeing 737\nEMERGENCY INFORMATION\nLISTEN CAREFULLY\nto instructions given\nby flight attendants or\nother crew members\nKEEP\nSEAT BELT\nFASTENED\nAT ALL TIMES\nSEAT BELTS: snap type\nto release: lift\npull to tighten\nthen pull\nOXYGEN MASKS:\nDURING TAKEOFF AND LANDING, PLEASE\nseat-back\nup,\n1. pull mask to face\ntray table\nup,\nplace\ncarry-on baggage under\nseat in front of you.\n2. pull elastic band over head\n3. adjust\nNO SMOKING:\n•when no-smoking sign\nis illuminated\n• while in lavatories\nor aisle\n•when seated in\nnon-smoking section\n• no cigars at any time\nPORTABLE ELECTRONIC DEVICES: Federal Aviation Agency regulations prohibit the operation\nof some devices while in flight. Please check with the flight attendant about your unit.",
      "BRACE POSITIONS:\nbottom seat\ncushion is\nfloatable\ngrasp firmly\nand pull from\nseat frame\nEMERGENCY\nINFORMATION\nDOOR EXIT WITH SLIDE:\nnormal\nalternate\n1. approach door\n2. rotate handle fully\n4.\nWINDOW EXITS:\nDEXITI\npull chute handle\nremove shoes\nEXIT (0\n3. open door\njump\nsit\nslide\nproceed to\naft wing\narea\n000\nstep out of\nwindow\nfoot first\npull handle,\nremove door\nDOOR EXIT WITH STAIR:\nrelease\nhandle\nslide down flaps\nEVACUATION ROUTES: 6 EXITS\n2 overwing exits\n2 rear exits\n2 forward exits\npull\nhandle\ninward\nand\ndown\nwhen\nplacard\nbecomes\nvisible,\npush\nstairs\nup\nand\noutward\nafter evacuation,\nquickly leave the\narea near aircraft\nPlease note: this card is not to be removed from aircraft\nFORM # AC-1998\n1 MAY '80"
    ],
